  "notes": "Improve evidence passages and preserve qualifications; distinguish pages read from search snippets and use complete short quotes. Keep stable source IDs across research and page tools, cache repeated research within a turn, and correct clearly invalid references at most once with an explicit warning if they remain unverified. Enforce no-web requests at tool execution; filter unrelated memory context while preserving explicit personal recall. Preserve model choices, hybrid fallback and chat data. Reference membership does not guarantee factual support.",
